00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:50.580
Chapter 23 Truth

00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:54.860
Hey!

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:01.980
They've done it!

00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:18.360
The flare went off near Sanjo.

00:02:18.750 --> 00:02:19.530
We're going there, quickly!

00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:22.030
Truth

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:22.030
Yes, sir!

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:23.870
Damn it!

00:02:23.870 --> 00:02:26.500
We had all these people with us,
and we ended up with the short straw!

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:28.410
That pisses me off!

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:32.410
So, it was those four that
drew the winning straw.

00:02:32.410 --> 00:02:34.040
We need not worry.

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:36.510
Right about now, they should be up
against the Choshu clansmen and...

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:38.300
We're hurrying there!

00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:41.540
There's no knowing what we may find.

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:21.000
Damn...

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.000
My head still...

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:30.660
What? You still wanna keep at it?

00:03:30.660 --> 00:03:33.070
You think after just that,
you've won against me?

00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:11.400
That hair...

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:14.200
I never imagined...

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:15.770
a foreign <i>kunoichi</i>.

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:20.780
Why didn't you stab me?

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:26.910
What about you?

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:29.160
Why didn't you strike a vital point?

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:33.120
I'm just sick of it.

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:36.370
Of being at the mercy of
other people's whims,

00:04:36.370 --> 00:04:38.250
and of cheap interactions...

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:41.750
Honestly...

00:04:41.750 --> 00:04:44.120
You don't pull your punches,
even against women, do you?

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:49.180
You broke one of my back teeth.

00:04:51.910 --> 00:04:54.450
With a battered face like this,

00:04:54.450 --> 00:04:56.910
I can't keep you company anymore.

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:13.700
Goodbye, Watcher Susumu Yamazaki.

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:17.670
If we ever meet again, I'm sure...

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:21.320
neither of us will likely be spies.

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:25.690
I'll be praying that I never see you again.

00:05:27.950 --> 00:05:28.880
As will I.

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:45.620
I am Suzu Kitamura!

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:47.340
I am Master Yoshida's page!

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:49.990
The Wolves of Mibu...

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:52.790
The Shinsengumi came for us!

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:54.790
Please help us!

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:55.980
I am begging you!

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:03.120
Please, Mr. Katsura,
you can hear me, can't you?!

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:06.130
Hurry!

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:08.840
Please hurry and open the gate!

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:12.160
Only a small number came to Ikedaya!

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:13.760
If we go now, it will not be too late!

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:15.140
Your men!

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:18.640
Please lend us your men!

00:06:19.450 --> 00:06:20.800
I am begging you!

00:06:27.910 --> 00:06:29.040
Damn it...

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:32.860
Damn it... Damn it!

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:39.370
Damn it!!

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:42.450
Are you that afraid of the Wolves of Mibu?!

00:06:42.450 --> 00:06:44.680
Don't you care if your
comrades are killed?!

00:06:45.830 --> 00:06:46.920
And you...

00:06:47.980 --> 00:06:51.660
And you call yourselves
exclusionist loyalists?!

00:07:00.910 --> 00:07:03.790
Please...

00:07:03.790 --> 00:07:05.320
I am begging you...

00:07:06.080 --> 00:07:07.150
My master...

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:11.790
Don't kill him...

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:30.250
Why?

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:32.840
Why did you...?

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:53.950
Tetsu!

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:58.000
Why, you damn, half-dead bastard!

00:07:58.000 --> 00:07:59.910
Please wait!

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:02.660
Please don't interfere yet.

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:05.200
What are you saying, Soji?!

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:07.080
It will be all right.

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:08.160
Because the one to win...

00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:10.550
will be our boy.

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:15.790
With that leg,

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:19.290
Yoshida can barely support
his weight, much less walk.

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:23.620
For him to be able to manage
with just his right arm, Tetsu...

00:08:25.290 --> 00:08:27.800
Tetsu would have to be slower than he is.

00:09:15.830 --> 00:09:16.960
Tetsu!

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:25.440
Not yet...

00:09:32.830 --> 00:09:33.980
Not yet.

00:09:54.700 --> 00:09:57.910
Looks like... he actually won...

00:09:57.910 --> 00:10:00.190
Yes, that seems to be the case.

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:06.290
Why did you let me live two years ago?!

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:08.040
Why did you wait until now...

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:10.960
to try and kill me?!

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:14.050
You must have known I
was there back then, too.

00:10:14.660 --> 00:10:16.620
You must have known I was there,

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:18.190
hiding behind my dad!

00:10:20.950 --> 00:10:22.670
What are you talking about?

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:25.420
What?

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:38.560
Tetsu!

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:50.330
<i>If I don't kill...</i>

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:54.400
<i>I'll be killed...</i>

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:34.060
Remember what you said?

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:39.120
Don't use it for killing.

00:11:39.120 --> 00:11:42.260
You must make sure to use it to protect.

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:43.760
Right?

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:17.210
Ikedaya

00:12:16.160 --> 00:12:17.210
Hey!

00:12:17.620 --> 00:12:20.120
That's all the ones we've captured, right?

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:21.200
Yes, sir!

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:23.700
There should still be more
Choshu clansmen that got away.

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:24.680
Go find them.

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:26.580
Yes, sir!

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:27.870
Don't slip up, now.

00:12:27.870 --> 00:12:29.290
Yes, sir!

00:12:30.030 --> 00:12:31.600
You guys...

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:35.350
Damn it...

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:38.040
You got some kind of problem?

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:39.650
What is it, Sano?

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:44.870
Wha-Wha-Wha...

00:12:44.870 --> 00:12:47.200
You... You... You, you, you...

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:49.620
You bastards!!

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:51.660
How dare you guys get hurt?!

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:52.370
If you ever die,

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:55.830
Ikedaya

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:55.830
I'm gonna kill you, so help me!

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:58.750
Ai

00:12:57.200 --> 00:12:58.750
Well, well, well!

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:01.370
You have done a truly admirable job here!

00:13:01.370 --> 00:13:04.380
I am sure Lord Katamori will be pleased!

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:06.330
Pardon my late introduction.

00:13:06.330 --> 00:13:09.910
I am an Aizu clansman, Sakon Kasuya.

00:13:09.910 --> 00:13:12.250
Huh? What're you guys doing, coming...?

00:13:12.250 --> 00:13:15.370
Very good of you to come,
all of you of Aizu.

00:13:15.370 --> 00:13:17.660
I'm sorry to say this after you
came all the way out here,

00:13:17.660 --> 00:13:19.900
but the raid is over for the most part.

00:13:21.250 --> 00:13:24.870
We will be fine with the
Shinsengumi withdrawing now.

00:13:24.870 --> 00:13:27.410
We may have had some trouble
coordinating with the military governor,

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:30.950
but now that we have arrived,
you have nothing to worry about.

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:32.750
All right, we're heading in!

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:34.660
Yes, sir!

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:36.200
That is such bull!

00:13:36.200 --> 00:13:37.930
You're trying to take credit for...

00:13:37.160 --> 00:13:39.960
Now, now, we don't need
to make a stink about this.

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:43.620
We've got a charm to ward off
the evil, so I'm sure it'll be fine.

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:45.200
Well, hello, Hijikata.

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:47.410
You have done your duty well here.

00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:49.550
Now, we will take care of the rest...

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:53.930
We were able to take care of
it all even without your help.

00:13:54.250 --> 00:13:56.290
Well, that is fine for you to say,

00:13:56.290 --> 00:13:58.700
but allow those of us from Aizu
and Kuwana to take care of this.

00:13:58.700 --> 00:14:00.110
I would ask you to please leave!

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:02.120
From this point on,

00:14:02.120 --> 00:14:06.190
having so many of you crowding
in here will only get in the way!

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:09.820
Hey, Toshi!

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:13.580
That is being far too rude
to the gentlemen of Aizu.

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:16.000
Ah, Kondo!

00:14:17.910 --> 00:14:19.540
Well, I am sorry to inconvenience you,

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:22.290
but we need to account for all the ronin,

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:24.170
so would you please make some room?

00:14:24.450 --> 00:14:28.120
There now, your clothes will get dirty.

00:14:28.120 --> 00:14:29.010
Yes...

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:32.040
Men, we shall stand by
outside for the time being!

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:33.870
Yes, sir!

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:41.100
Toshi...

00:14:41.620 --> 00:14:44.080
You went a little too far in
what you said, don't you think?

00:14:44.080 --> 00:14:47.290
I doubt what little I said
will come back to haunt me.

00:14:47.290 --> 00:14:49.820
Well, leave this to me.

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:52.820
He's in the room facing the back yard.

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:54.560
Hurry up and go to him.

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:57.120
Thanks.

00:15:17.250 --> 00:15:19.120
Mr. Hijikata...

00:15:25.080 --> 00:15:26.400
Mr. Hijikata...

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:30.160
Soji!

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:32.360
The blood... You're not...

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:37.950
You mustn't, Vice Commander!

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:39.960
He may have some broken ribs!

00:15:42.910 --> 00:15:46.160
Mr. Hijikata, you should
see the look on your face.

00:15:46.160 --> 00:15:47.410
Don't worry.

00:15:47.410 --> 00:15:50.880
None of this blood is mine.

00:15:52.040 --> 00:15:53.760
At any rate, we need to get you medicine.

00:15:54.080 --> 00:15:54.920
Hey!

00:15:54.920 --> 00:15:56.500
Yes, sir?!

00:15:56.500 --> 00:15:57.660
Bring some tea!

00:15:57.660 --> 00:15:59.430
Or even hot water will do! Quickly!

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:00.850
Yes, sir!

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:07.210
So it's not?

00:16:08.330 --> 00:16:09.230
No.

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:18.200
Here you are.

00:16:36.080 --> 00:16:37.550
Thank you.

00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:45.480
So, this was your first cup of
tea served on the battlefield.

00:16:47.290 --> 00:16:51.720
And that tea turned out weak,
and lukewarm to boot.

00:16:56.330 --> 00:16:58.120
For a page of mine,

00:16:58.120 --> 00:17:00.080
that's a job well done.

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:03.290
Can you stand, Soji?

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:04.210
Yes.

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:06.580
Gather everyone out front for me.

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:07.620
Yes, sir.

00:17:07.620 --> 00:17:09.870
Thank you very much for the medicine.

00:17:09.870 --> 00:17:11.410
I'm fine now.

00:17:11.410 --> 00:17:13.000
Hmm? Right.

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:14.250
Ouch!

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:15.380
Ichimura!

00:17:15.950 --> 00:17:18.500
Quit staring off into space and
get that cleaned up right away!

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:19.680
Yes, sir!

00:17:20.580 --> 00:17:23.160
Jyusuke Matsuda of the Higo Clan,

00:17:23.160 --> 00:17:25.310
Kitsuma Kitazoe of the Tosa Clan,

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:26.600
and five others were brought down.

00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:29.900
This is Teizo Miyabe of the Higo Clan.

00:17:29.210 --> 00:17:29.900
Soji.

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:33.450
He's as big as Yoshida.
You go on ahead back to Headquarters.

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:34.970
I'm fine.

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:06.200
Master, I came back for you.

00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:09.390
Please, we need to go,

00:19:10.700 --> 00:19:12.410
or the Wolves of Mibu will come...

00:19:15.450 --> 00:19:17.790
Your head is gone...

00:19:17.790 --> 00:19:18.880
Master...

00:19:19.950 --> 00:19:20.800
And your arm...

00:19:21.790 --> 00:19:23.850
They're not here. Master...

00:19:31.410 --> 00:19:36.110
Men, your work tonight
was truly commendable!

00:19:36.330 --> 00:19:40.080
Since there are some injured among us,
we will return to Headquarters for now!

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:40.900
Let's go!

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:42.830
Yeah!

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:47.620
That ear... Better sew it
on fast, or it won't stick.

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:50.250
Susumu, you...

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:54.040
Were you watching?

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:56.450
Yeah, I was.

00:19:56.450 --> 00:19:58.500
Why don't you go with them?

00:19:58.500 --> 00:20:01.720
Hmm? Well...

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:06.930
When you think about it,
I'm still a page, after all...

00:20:07.290 --> 00:20:10.790
And I still feel kind of
weird in this uniform.

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:12.830
What about you? Aren't you going?

00:20:12.830 --> 00:20:14.040
Moron!

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:17.160
There's no point in being a spy if
I go walking brazenly around here.

00:20:17.160 --> 00:20:18.270
Right.

00:20:18.790 --> 00:20:22.200
Besides, I came out here today to
take care of some personal business.

00:20:22.500 --> 00:20:24.200
Really.

00:20:26.540 --> 00:20:30.120
You know, I think I'll go after all.

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:31.080
Ichimura.

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:33.460
Well...

00:20:33.910 --> 00:20:35.700
How should I put it?

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:38.570
You've got a pretty strong
side to you, you know that?

00:20:39.750 --> 00:20:42.420
What?! I didn't hear you clearly!

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:44.620
Come on, say it one more time!

00:20:44.620 --> 00:20:45.370
Come on, hurry!

00:20:45.370 --> 00:20:46.960
Beat it, you fool!

00:20:45.370 --> 00:20:47.700
Ikedaya

00:20:51.750 --> 00:20:52.430
There.

00:20:53.040 --> 00:20:55.500
Now, you're all clean.

00:20:58.620 --> 00:21:01.980
We're going home, Master.

00:21:12.830 --> 00:21:14.250
Master...

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:27.620
Mr. Hijikata.

00:21:27.620 --> 00:21:31.060
I'm sure he will be fine.

00:21:31.580 --> 00:21:34.000
Because he's a strong child...

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:36.520
Because he won't become like me...

00:21:38.200 --> 00:21:39.110
Sorry for being late!

00:22:02.620 --> 00:22:06.910
<i>Gripping the microphone tight,
the hit parade's on parade</i>

00:22:06.910 --> 00:22:10.450
<i>Hey, Jimmy, how you feeling?</i>

00:22:10.450 --> 00:22:14.790
<i>Quite the gentleman when he's off stage</i>

00:22:14.790 --> 00:22:18.450
<i>Hey, Jimmy, a generous spirit too!</i>

00:22:18.450 --> 00:22:22.320
<i>Being such an honest guy,
even his life's plain</i>

00:22:22.320 --> 00:22:26.290
<i>Keep building it up patiently</i>

00:22:26.290 --> 00:22:30.290
<i>May your dreams come true honestly</i>

00:22:30.290 --> 00:22:34.120
<i>Let's go for it again today, Jimmy</i>

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:39.660
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:22:39.660 --> 00:22:43.500
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:47.500
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:22:47.500 --> 00:22:51.550
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:23:07.190 --> 00:23:11.030
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:23:11.030 --> 00:23:15.330
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:23:15.330 --> 00:23:19.000
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:23.330
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:23:24.670 --> 00:23:27.920
Next Peacemaker Kurogane

00:23:26.120 --> 00:23:27.920
<i>I heard.</i>

